# Exports and throwaway fixtures dropped at the repo root. Root-anchored so that
# real fixtures under src/**/__fixtures__/ stay committable. A CSV export of the
# LIVE dataset is real financial data — this rule is a safety net, not tidiness.
/*.csv
# Same net, same reasoning, added after a 650 KB SMIDA feed dump (`smf.xml`) was
# found sitting unignored at the root of a PUBLIC repo — one `git add -A` from
# being published. The two backup names the app itself writes are covered by name rather
# than by extension: a bare `/*.json` would also swallow a new root config.
/*.xml
/quirenote-backup-*.json
/quirenote-before-import-*.json

# Built by the deploy workflow; never committed.
infra/dist/
infra/.aws-sam/
